===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} A condition in which [[tissue]]s (especially the [[blood]]) are deprived of an adequate supply of [[oxygen]]; [[anoxia]]
# A reduced concentration of dissolved oxygen in an [[aquatic]] environment.

